        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Wien Liesing, Vienna, Graz, Spielfeld, Slovenia\n- Systems: Southern Railway\n- Concepts: standard gauge, mountain railways\n\nFacts:\n- Wien Liesing railway station opened in the same year as the Southern Railway.\n- The Southern Railway runs from Vienna to Graz and to the Slovenia border at Spielfeld.\n- The Southern Railway passes via the first mountain railway in Europe built to use standard gauge track.",
